 "PROGRAMMING", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(11, 1, 1)", "section": "skills", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "} EDUCATION", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(12, 1, 1)", "section": "heading:education", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "American University —- Washington, DC", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(13, 1, 1)", "section": "education", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "School of Public Affairs, Bachelor of Arts in Political Science", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(13, 1, 2)", "section": "education", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "American University — Washington, DC WINTER 2008", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(14, 1, 1)", "section": "education", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "Center for Congressional and Presidential Studies, Campaign Management Institute", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(14, 1, 2)", "section": "education", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "SPRING 2007", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(15, 1, 1)", "section": "education", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "MAY 2008", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(16, 1, 1)", "section": "education", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "University of Exeter -— United Kingdom", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(17, 1, 1)", "section": "education", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "College of Social Sciences and International Studies, Study Abroad", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(17, 1, 2)", "section": "education", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "© work EXPERIENCE", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(18, 1, 1)", "section": "heading:experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "Co-Founder & Partner", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(19, 1, 1)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "Politech LLC — Las Vegas, Nevada", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(19, 1, 2)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "DEC 2012 - CURRENT", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(20, 1, 1)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "= Managed all client-facing functions of the business including sales, marketing, customer", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(21, 1, 1)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "service, product management. and operations", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(21, 1, 2)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "Launched a custom reporting web application for Organizing for Action that supported their", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(21, 1, 3)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "national program with over 100 staff and 2000 volunteers", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(21, 1, 4)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "Brought a new SaaS reporting web application, Blocks (http://blocks.im) to market that is used", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(21, 1, 5)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "by political campaigns and issue advocacy groups including Everytown for Gun Safety and", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(21, 1, 6)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "Virginia Victory 2014", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(21, 1, 7)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "Developed an automated ETL system for the Ohio Democratic Party that processed over", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(21, 1, 8)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "850,000 absentee ballots from all 88 counties on a twice-daily basis in advance of election day", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(21, 1, 9)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "Consulted as a senior strategist and data advisor on the Measure 92 (GMO Labeling) campaign", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(21, 1, 10)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "in Oregon, including creating the data tracking and audit system for the full statewide recount", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(21, 1, 11)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "of over 1,500,000 ballots", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(21, 1, 12)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "Product managed the creation of 7 full stack web applications including Downbeat", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(21, 1, 13)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "(http://downbeat.io) and Playbook Rewards (http://playbookrewards.com)", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(21, 1, 14)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "Nevada State Data Director", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(22, 1, 1)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "Obama for America - Las Vegas, Nevada", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(22, 1, 2)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "SEP 2011 — NOV 2012", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(23, 1, 1)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "®& Managed a data and reporting team of 5 data specialists and analysts", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(24, 1, 1)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "@ Managed a technology team of 5 engineers in an agile development environment", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(24, 2, 1)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "® Only battleground state with a state specific tech development program; Nevada built 4", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(24, 3, 1)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "full-stack responsive Ruby-on-Rails web applications that were vital to Nevada's path to", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(24, 3, 2)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "victory", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(24, 3, 3)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "Created and implemented data, targeting. technology, and analytics plans spanning 6 phases", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(24, 3, 4)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "of the campaign (capacity building caucus, voter registration, persuasion, early voting,", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(24, 3, 5)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "get-out-the-vote)", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(24, 3, 6)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "Architected a data-driven targeting program resulting in over 5,000,000 calls and over", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(24, 3, 7)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "1,000,000 knocks", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(24, 3, 8)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "Created a web application that powered a field operation to register over 90,000 voter", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(24, 3, 9)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "applicants", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(24, 3, 10)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "Developed a data and technology architecture that supported a campaign organization with", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(24, 3, 11)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "over 160 field staff. 400 paid canvassers, 300 volunteer leaders, and 1,800 volunteers.", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(24, 3, 12)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}, {"text": "Won Nevada, a top 3 battleground state for President Barack Obama by 6.68 points", "page": 1, "method": "ocr", "block_id": "ocr-1-(24, 3, 13)", "section": "experience", "x": 0, "y": 0}]